  "details": "This module enables you to take payments via multiple Stripe APIs.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently verify the cryptographic signature of a webhook event when a signing secret has not been properly configured in the payment gateway settings.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that not all payment gateway plugins in the module utilize webhooks. Furthermore, any payment gateway configuration with any value for its webhook signing secret will prevent inappropriate processing.",
